{
  "id": "gen-julia-set",
  "name": "Julia Set \u2014 Orbit Trap",
  "url": "shaders/gen_julia_set.wgsl",
  "description": "Generalised Julia set iteration z^n+c for n=2..6 with smooth iteration count, circle/line/cross orbit traps and a velocity trap, c orbiting a cardioid. A distance estimate lights a thin lace along the set's true boundary, and the interior bands around each attracting cycle. Audio-driven trap scale.",
